Inventory:
ASP.NET WebForms application (.NET Framework). Entry points are the pages' event handlers.
- Page Comprobante (Comprobante.aspx, code-behind Comprobante.aspx.cs): inputs none
  - Page_Load (lines 9-23): reads TRANSFERENCIAS, writes no table; shows lblMonto, lblNumero
- Page Transferencia (Transferencia.aspx, code-behind Transferencia.aspx.cs): inputs txtCuentaOrigen (TextBox, max 10), txtCuentaDestino (TextBox, max 10), txtMonto (TextBox, max 9), ddlTipo (DropDownList)
  - Page_Load (lines 9-15): reads no table, writes no table; shows lblMensaje
  - btnTransferir_Click (lines 17-107): reads CUENTAS, TRANSFERENCIAS, writes CUENTAS, TRANSFERENCIAS; shows lblComision, lblMensaje; to Comprobante.aspx
- App_Code ComisionService.Calcular(decimal monto, string tipo) -> decimal (App_Code/ComisionService.cs:8-20)
The legacy cannot run here (WebForms needs .NET Framework on Windows): it is observed through recorded traces of TRANSFERENCIA.
Uplift assessment: App_Code/ComisionService.cs: uplift, Comprobante.aspx: rewrite, Comprobante.aspx.cs: rewrite, Transferencia.aspx: rewrite, Transferencia.aspx.cs: rewrite, Web.config: replace.

